  "notes": [
    "Phase 1: no rig, weights or animations. Same keys as the folk-bunny / Usagi joints.json (final metres).",
    "head = the head centre (the radial origin); head_nod_pivot_suggested = base of the skull, for the rig.",
    "Head skin = zero surface of one convex implicit ball (squircle skull + jaw + muzzle cushions + nose), analytic normals, toon-band refinement; no eye sockets.",
    "Upper lash lines: separate ribbons (DogA_lash_L / _R: the line, its wing and a flick), origin at the eye centre, for the upper lids.",
    "Eyelid holes ringed by 6 loops each with the rim rolled in behind separate lens eyeballs; 3 loops round the mouth, 4 round the nose.",
    "Ears: separate drooping paddles (DogA_ear_L / _R), 28 rings along a curved centreline (bend loops), pivot = ears.base (where the root runs along the skull corner).",
    "Leaf: DogA_leaf rides the head bone, pivot = leaf.",
    "Tail: DogA_tail, a thick swept bean (22 rings, bend loops), root = tail[0]."
  ]
